Comment: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳呢?
Comment: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會說妳的名字嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,叫做菲布理啊
Comment: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 菲布理
Comment: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼都可以
Comment: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能告訴我妳知道的事情嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂美琴
Comment: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我?
