Comment: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會不會其實是御坂認識的人啊?
Comment: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,印象中是沒有...
Comment: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是不是親戚或是表妹呢?
Comment: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會不會是同父異母的親妹妹啊?
Comment: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我說啊...
Comment: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.09,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,這種妹妹我已經有了...
Comment: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該...該不會是...
Comment: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.79,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人自己也不知道!?
Comment: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:51.72,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,這到底怎麼回事!?
Comment: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.63,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,我說的到底是不是真...
Comment: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好痛...
Comment: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就是御坂美琴唷~
Comment: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會知道我呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然還是小孩子了解呢
Comment: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰比較安全 誰比較危險之類的
Comment: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還有這個東西!!
Comment: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,手指玩偶?
Comment: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,買果汁送的啦
