Comment: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是一如往常喜歡這些東西呢
Comment: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我叫做呱太
Comment: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理妹妹呀
