Comment: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是漢堡肉唷
Comment: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好吃嗎
Comment: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好
Comment: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.45,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼把眼睛緊緊~的閉上!
Comment: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沖啊
