Comment: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:36.99,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,可以換妳幫我沖嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊
Comment: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,小心小心
Comment: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要跌倒了
Comment: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,小心一點...
Comment: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,淚子 沒事吧?
Comment: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.73,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,妳這個小調皮!
Comment: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂
Comment: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳快點來啦
Comment: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初初~
Comment: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好
Comment: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:11.73,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,妳整個被陰暗壟罩喔
Comment: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又...又沒關係
Comment: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,反正只是個贈品而已
Comment: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是一個手指玩偶...
Comment: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一個...
Comment: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看起來一點都不像沒關係的樣子
Comment: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我只是在想...
Comment: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那孩子
Comment: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會知道我的名字...
Comment: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且又這麼怕我...之類的
Comment: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道姐姐大人這麼想要被那個幼女喜歡嗎!?
Comment: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳很希望這樣吧 姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這下我了解了
Comment: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這樣的話
Comment: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井黑子我 就特別為了姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.05,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,叭哺~~~
Comment: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 白井
Comment: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在吵什麼啊!?
Comment: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過說真的
Comment: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼那孩子
Comment: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會知道我的名字呢
Comment: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還真是有點奇怪的小孩呢
Comment: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,很可愛唷
Comment: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:08:45.49,0:08:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,的確...
Comment: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這味道還真是強烈啊
Comment: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧 很厲害吧
Comment: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還真虧她吃得下去耶...
Comment: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳好過分啊 佐天
Comment: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,昨天晚上妳還跟我說
Comment: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「這超好吃的」 拿給我舔
Comment: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就說對不起了嘛~
Comment: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好吃嗎?
Comment: 0,0:09:09.77,0:09:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了呢 菲布理妹妹
Comment: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還真的完全沒有她的資料
Comment: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這個記載失蹤人口和走失兒童的資料庫也是
Comment: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,輸入了情報
Comment: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是到目前為止都還沒有反應
Comment: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說 這孩子
Comment: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.41,Default,exp,0,0,0,karaoke,很有可能是棄童
Comment: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.41,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1111,980)\fscx65}Child Error
Comment: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,午安~
Comment: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,搬家後的事都處理得差不多了 就來打個招呼了
Comment: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,跑到那種地方去了
Comment: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給人添麻煩的小鬼
Comment: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那孩子
Comment: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是棄童嗎?
Comment: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.98,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fscx65\pos(947,980)}Child Error
Comment: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是這樣
Comment: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然用了很多方法
Comment: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是找不到她的出生資料
Comment: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在只能等設施的人來了
Comment: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果能到一個好的設施去就好了
Comment: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,設施有分好壞啊?
Comment: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,據說根據設施不同
Comment: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也會有各式各樣不同的缺點
Comment: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能選擇送去的地方嗎?
Comment: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸 初春
Comment: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有沒有設施的評價
Comment: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,或是排名之類的啊?
Comment: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個稍微有點...
Comment: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我和對方確認了
Comment: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來是可以接受她
Comment: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望之園說可以
Comment: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是在13區的設施
Comment: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以前有去打擾過
Comment: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是個氣氛非常溫暖的地方
Comment: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是有一個問題
Comment: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,直到準備好可以接進去了
Comment: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最快也要五天
Comment: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個沒有問題
Comment: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在那之前我會好好照顧她的
Comment: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也可以從旁協助
Comment: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我當然也是
Comment: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是這樣 那我就幫忙
Comment: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
Comment: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會告訴對方
Comment: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,暫時和我們在一起一陣子好嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和淚子一起...?
Comment: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯
Comment: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有大家喔
Comment: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春?
Comment: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子也...?
Comment: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,美偉也是?
Comment: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然囉 菲布理
Comment: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼...
Comment: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,五天啊
Comment: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼在學究會前都能待在一起呢
Comment: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼說來
Comment: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,差不多要到會場警備的會合時間了吧?
Comment: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還要再來玩唷
Comment: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的
Comment: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,下次會和絆理一起來
Comment: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,掰掰
Comment: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再見~衿衣
Comment: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,連春上的名字也...!
Comment: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:21.80,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,好快喔~~
Comment: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也一定要
Comment: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定要讓這孩子
Comment: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,叫我的名字!
Comment: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:28.10,Default,break,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:31.06,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡真的是學究會的會場嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該是說其中之一的會場喔
Comment: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣說來
Comment: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該怎麼說 很寂寞啊
Comment: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學究會
Comment: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和能力無關
Comment: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,純粹是發表學業研究的成果
Comment: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不論怎麼樣也要辦得風風光光...
Comment: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,變成一股狂熱潮了
Comment: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳好像非常失望的樣子
Comment: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:00.75,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,到底把學究會想像成什麼東西啊?
Comment: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有啦~~~那個
Comment: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有很多小店和活動
Comment: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家聚在一起徹夜準備...像這樣子
Comment: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以才一起跟來啊
Comment: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是這種樣子的話
Comment: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這孩子也不會無聊
Comment: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧?
Comment: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧?
Comment: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧?
Comment: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可...好可愛
Comment: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊~這不是御坂嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哎呀 真的是
Comment: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真巧啊
Comment: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼?
Comment: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后光子
Comment: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會在這裡...
Comment: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳好
Comment: 0,0:13:34.61,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初次見面
Comment: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:37.80,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,我叫做泡浮萬彬
Comment: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼說 灣內妳們的學姐
Comment: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有參加學究會啊?
Comment: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對啊 而且我也有去幫忙準備呢
Comment: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是我和泡浮私下認識的人
Comment: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后義無反顧的來幫忙
Comment: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不需要在意
Comment: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對我而言準備什麼的
Comment: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是在一瞬間就可以完成的事
Comment: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了 御坂
Comment: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那位是誰的妹妹嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,稍微有點複雜呢
Comment: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后
Comment: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這位可愛的小孩
Comment: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,叫做菲布理
Comment: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛答應要和我做朋友唷
Comment: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也請務必和我做朋友喔
Comment: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是婚后光子
Comment: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請多多指教喔
Comment: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,多多指教 光子
Comment: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我又多一個朋友了
Comment: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚...連婚后也...
Comment: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼各位
Comment: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請保重
Comment: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,掰掰~
Comment: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 我們要去會合了喔
Comment: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們會好好看著的
Comment: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,集合場所在哪裡啊?
Comment: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後 這次我一定要...!
Comment: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等喔
Comment: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我記得是...
Comment: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這會場還真是大得誇張啊
Comment: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了 初春
Comment: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,洗手間在哪裡啊?
Comment: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我記得在..
Comment: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 我帶妳去吧
Comment: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麻煩妳了
Comment: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,淚子...
Comment: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒關係的喔
Comment: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我馬上就回來
Comment: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在我回來前
Comment: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能和美琴姐姐一起等我嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我稍微離開一下
Comment: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這期間...
Comment: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等我唷
Comment: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請慢走
Comment: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這校園還真大
Comment: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,警備的人員需要再增加一點...
Comment: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是
Comment: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,寄送的地址應該是這裡沒錯
Comment: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,文件上是這麼寫的...
Comment: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是
Comment: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們並沒有領取的權限
Comment: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有什麼問題嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,似乎是學究會的贊助品
Comment: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要來領取的學生還沒有過來
Comment: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學究會的得獎常勝軍
Comment: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是啊
Comment: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,其他的會場也是
Comment: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今年都還沒有看到常勝軍的人
Comment: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦
Comment: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒什麼
Comment: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛好像看到了常勝軍的人...
Comment: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我到達會場了
Comment: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些東西也平安搬入了
Comment: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,了解
Comment: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發現對象我再連絡你
Comment: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳肚子餓不餓?
Comment: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 要不要喝點什麼?
Comment: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看 菲布理
Comment: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那朵花非常漂亮唷
Comment: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,淚子還沒回來嗎?
Comment: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我這麼認真的用小孩語言配合
Comment: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,小孩應該會喜歡的啊!
Comment: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼能因為這點小事就屈服!
Comment: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這樣
Comment: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算再被拿走也沒關係
Comment: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,珍寶中的珍寶
Comment: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,中獎機率只有{\fnTimes New Roman} ― {\r}的彩虹呱太!
Comment: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs55\pos(982,1077)}60
Comment: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs55\pos(981,1015)}1
Comment: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看 菲布理
Comment: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,莫非...
Comment: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!?
Comment: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打工真~的~熱到超難受的
Comment: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇喔~~
Comment: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是哪來的可愛蘿莉女孩
Comment: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,跑掉了
Comment: 0,0:17:58.59,0:17:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,呱太...
Comment: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我視線才離開一下下...
Comment: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒關係的
Comment: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該不會跑太遠
Comment: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也一起找
Comment: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託妳了
Comment: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂?
Comment: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,淚子...
Comment: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初初...
Comment: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子...
Comment: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,美偉...
Comment: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在哪裡...?
Comment: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發現對象了
Comment: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,找到了!
Comment: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,衿衣...
Comment: 0,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,光子...
Comment: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是...!
Comment: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了...
Comment: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊咧
Comment: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,淚子!!
Comment: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒事就好了
Comment: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會錯的
Comment: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是本人
Comment: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,遇到了這種事情啊
Comment: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒事就好了
Comment: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不應該把視線移開的
Comment: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的很對不起 佐天
Comment: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該道歉的是我
Comment: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼...
Comment: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來 菲布理也一起
Comment: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳讓美琴姐姐非常擔心
Comment: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不道歉不行唷
Comment: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理...
Comment: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起...
Comment: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝 美琴
Comment: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙!
Comment: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等 菲布理
Comment: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要~~~
Comment: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等 等等
Comment: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好可怕喔~~~
Comment: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知不覺感情變得很好了呢
Comment: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,開心比什麼都來得重要
Comment: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不枉費我婚后勞心勞力的價值了
Comment: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哎呀 婚后
Comment: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,自己說自己立下功勞很讓人見笑唷
Comment: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這...這次我真的有派上用場喔!
Comment: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才怪才怪
Comment: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的真的啦!
Comment: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好啦好啦 我知道了~~
Comment: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絕對是真的啦!
Comment: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個學園都市中僅有的七名超能力者
Comment: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.70,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1327,980)}Level 5
Comment: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在排名第四之後
Comment: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也能和第三位進行實驗
Comment: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,除了棒以外沒話說了
Comment: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼和往常一樣 表決吧
Comment: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對於超電磁砲
Comment: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:49.75,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1020,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,贊成進行實驗的請舉手
Comment: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然
Comment: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也贊成
Comment: 0,0:05:56.87,0:05:58.87,explaination,exp,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:07.80,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.09,0:23:32.39,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:32.15,0:23:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,小初春
Comment: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:35.72,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,初初
Comment: 0,0:23:36.05,0:23:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,春春
Comment: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,春初
Comment: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是誰...拜託這孩子作預告的
Comment: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,根本完全黏在一起了...
Comment: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:49.10,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:49.10,Default,export,0,0,0,,
