Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:06.28,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}叫做淚子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會說妳的名字嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}叫做菲布理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能告訴我妳知道的事情嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會不會其實是御坂認識的人啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}印象中是沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是不是親戚或是表妹呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會不會是同父異母的親妹妹啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.09,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種妹妹我已經有了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該...該不會是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.79,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人自己也不知道!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:51.72,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這到底怎麼回事!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.63,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說的到底是不是真...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我就是御坂美琴唷~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼會知道我呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然還是小孩子了解呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}誰比較安全 誰比較危險之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還有這個東西!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}手指玩偶?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}買果汁送的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了要抽中不知道喝掉了幾罐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是一如往常喜歡這些東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我叫做呱太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理妹妹呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我啊 有事情想要問妳唷...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.85,Default,eff,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個中獎機率只有{\fnTimes New Roman} ― {\r}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.85,Default,eff,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\fnTimes New Roman\pos(1173,1077)\fs55}24
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.85,Default,eff,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\fnTimes New Roman\pos(1173,1015)\fs55}1
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的粉紅呱太啊!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要因為一兩個手指玩偶就在那裡鬼吼鬼叫好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了 菲布理妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不可以隨便搶走別人的東西唷...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還真是會找安全的地方躲耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個呱太的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是美琴姐姐的東西唷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要還給她唷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要 這是菲布理的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在走失兒童的名單裡面沒有這個名字呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這個時間點
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也連絡不到警備員的負責人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:48.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(990,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這下傷腦筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天晚上我來照顧她好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也有弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也習慣照顧小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那...就不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以麻煩妳幫我照顧一個晚上嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我家有點小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}感覺只有一個人會有點辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以說 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以來幫我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個 初春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}整理好了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}舔舔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}舔舔?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還完整的唷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會不會是肚子餓了呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對了 要不要吃晚餐啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了 那就開始來當媽媽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我開動了~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是漢堡肉唷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.45,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼把眼睛緊緊~的閉上!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那現在該菲布理囉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:36.99,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以換妳幫我沖嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}小心小心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}小心一點...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子 沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.73,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳這個小調皮!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳快點來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初初~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:11.73,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳整個被陰暗壟罩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又...又沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}反正只是個贈品而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是一個手指玩偶...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一個...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看起來一點都不像沒關係的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我只是在想...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼會知道我的名字...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且又這麼怕我...之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道姐姐大人這麼想要被那個幼女喜歡嗎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳很希望這樣吧 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這下我了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井黑子我 就特別為了姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.05,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}叭哺~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 白井
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在吵什麼啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過說真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會知道我的名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還真是有點奇怪的小孩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很可愛唷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.49,0:08:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}的確...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這味道還真是強烈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧 很厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還真虧她吃得下去耶...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳好過分啊 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}昨天晚上妳還跟我說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「這超好吃的」 拿給我舔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就說對不起了嘛~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好吃嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.77,0:09:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太好了呢 菲布理妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還真的完全沒有她的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這個記載失蹤人口和走失兒童的資料庫也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}輸入了情報
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是到目前為止都還沒有反應
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是說 這孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.41,Default,exp,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很有可能是棄童
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.41,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1111,980)\fscx65}Child Error
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}午安~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}搬家後的事都處理得差不多了 就來打個招呼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}跑到那種地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給人添麻煩的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是棄童嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.98,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\fscx65\pos(947,980)}Child Error
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然用了很多方法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是找不到她的出生資料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在只能等設施的人來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果能到一個好的設施去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}設施有分好壞啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}據說根據設施不同
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也會有各式各樣不同的缺點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能選擇送去的地方嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有沒有設施的評價
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}或是排名之類的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個稍微有點...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我和對方確認了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看來是可以接受她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}希望之園說可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是在13區的設施
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以前有去打擾過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是個氣氛非常溫暖的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是有一個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}直到準備好可以接進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最快也要五天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在那之前我會好好照顧她的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也可以從旁協助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我當然也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果是這樣 那我就幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會告訴對方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}暫時和我們在一起一陣子好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和淚子一起...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有大家喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子也...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}美偉也是?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當然囉 菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}五天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼在學究會前都能待在一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼說來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}差不多要到會場警備的會合時間了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還要再來玩唷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}下次會和絆理一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}掰掰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再見~衿衣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}連春上的名字也...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:21.80,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好快喔~~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定要讓這孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}叫我的名字!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡真的是學究會的會場嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該是說其中之一的會場喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣說來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該怎麼說 很寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學究會
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和能力無關
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}純粹是發表學業研究的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不論怎麼樣也要辦得風風光光...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}變成一股狂熱潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳好像非常失望的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:00.75,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}到底把學究會想像成什麼東西啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有啦~~~那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有很多小店和活動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大家聚在一起徹夜準備...像這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以才一起跟來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果是這種樣子的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這孩子也不會無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可...好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊~這不是御坂嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哎呀 真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真巧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚后光子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼會在這裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.61,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:37.80,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我叫做泡浮萬彬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼說 灣內妳們的學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有參加學究會啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對啊 而且我也有去幫忙準備呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是我和泡浮私下認識的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚后義無反顧的來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不需要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對我而言準備什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是在一瞬間就可以完成的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對了 御坂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那位是誰的妹妹嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}稍微有點複雜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這位可愛的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}叫做菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛答應要和我做朋友唷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也請務必和我做朋友喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是婚后光子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請多多指教喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}多多指教 光子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我又多一個朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚...連婚后也...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請保重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}掰掰~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 我們要去會合了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們會好好看著的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}集合場所在哪裡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}然後 這次我一定要...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我記得是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這會場還真是大得誇張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對了 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}洗手間在哪裡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我記得在..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 我帶妳去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麻煩妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒關係的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我馬上就回來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在我回來前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能和美琴姐姐一起等我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我稍微離開一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這期間...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等我唷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這校園還真大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}警備的人員需要再增加一點...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}寄送的地址應該是這裡沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}文件上是這麼寫的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們並沒有領取的權限
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有什麼問題嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}似乎是學究會的贊助品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要來領取的學生還沒有過來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學究會的得獎常勝軍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}其他的會場也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今年都還沒有看到常勝軍的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}咦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛好像看到了常勝軍的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我到達會場了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那些東西也平安搬入了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發現對象我再連絡你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳肚子餓不餓?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 要不要喝點什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看 菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那朵花非常漂亮唷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子還沒回來嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我這麼認真的用小孩語言配合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}小孩應該會喜歡的啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼能因為這點小事就屈服!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算再被拿走也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}珍寶中的珍寶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}中獎機率只有{\fnTimes New Roman} ― {\r}的彩虹呱太!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\fnTimes New Roman\fs55\pos(982,1077)}60
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\fnTimes New Roman\fs55\pos(981,1015)}1
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看 菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}莫非...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打工真~的~熱到超難受的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇喔~~
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是哪來的可愛蘿莉女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.59,0:17:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}呱太...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我視線才離開一下下...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該不會跑太遠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也一起找
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初初...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}美偉...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在哪裡...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發現對象了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}找到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}衿衣...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}光子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊咧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是本人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}遇到了這種事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不應該把視線移開的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的很對不起 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該道歉的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來 菲布理也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳讓美琴姐姐非常擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不道歉不行唷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝 美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這傢伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等 菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好可怕喔~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不知不覺感情變得很好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}開心比什麼都來得重要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不枉費我婚后勞心勞力的價值了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哎呀 婚后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}自己說自己立下功勞很讓人見笑唷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這...這次我真的有派上用場喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才怪才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的真的啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好啦好啦 我知道了~~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對是真的啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個學園都市中僅有的七名超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.70,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1327,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在排名第四之後
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也能和第三位進行實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}除了棒以外沒話說了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼和往常一樣 表決吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對於超電磁砲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:49.75,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1020,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}贊成進行實驗的請舉手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當然
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.15,0:23:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}小初春
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:35.72,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初初
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.05,0:23:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}春春
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}春初
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是誰...拜託這孩子作預告的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}根本完全黏在一起了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:33.44,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}璀璨的希望終會穿越這座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:39.86,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}與永遠相互信任的同伴手牽著手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:46.91,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}隨著心兒  繼續尋找所相信的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:54.83,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}佇立在人群中 注視著你遠去的背影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:04:01.38,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}漸漸理解「甘苦共享」的重要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:08.14,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}幾份笑容如今依舊點染炫彩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:16.35,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}就是想要守護這份繚繞著大家的平常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:22.90,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}若讓伊始的夢想響徹蒼穹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:29.45,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}堅定不移的能力便會捉住現實
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:36.29,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}因為擁有承認軟弱的那份堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:42.84,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}為了永記心間  唯獨抱緊這份情誼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:49.51,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}挺起胸膛  衝破足以自豪的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:07.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:13.90,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}邁入的這個世界 對我來說過於廣闊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.15,0:22:20.28,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}掩蓋焦慮不安 逞強伸伸腰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.41,0:22:26.70,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}心中想著沒找到的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:33.13,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}毫無喘息空隙光陰荏苒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:39.84,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}若在反覆的日常中變得痛苦的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:43.55,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}便來一個深呼吸  你瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:49.81,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}向著彩虹揮灑的山丘上進發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:55.19,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}將難忘的今日也銘記於心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:59.61,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}為相遇道一聲「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.74,0:23:02.86,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}一定甚是珍貴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:08.12,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}向前邁進吧 銜接著明天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:12.12,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}互相會意而笑道「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:15.71,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}分享悲傷與喜悅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:26.18,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}來吧  將它們合二為一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.87,0:23:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
